{"data": [{"author_id": "1996551578187436033", "created_at": "2026-11-03T06:41:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117507442393424255"], "id": "2117507442393424255", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 719, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "📊 午后观点 | 先杀后拉：沪指从-1.46%收回-0.75%，可创业板还趴在-2.07%", "url": "https://x.com/YoooJJ8cm/status/2117507442393424255"}, {"author_id": "1842859757855772672", "created_at": "2026-11-03T08:56:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117541325046206499"], "id": "2117541325046206499", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "午后宽基ETF明显放量。\n\n华夏上证50ETF、易方达创业板ETF、华泰柏瑞沪深300ETF、华夏科创50ETF，同一日成交额全部突破100亿元。\n\n这是自2024年“924行情”以来，首次出现4只宽基ETF单日成交同时破百亿。", "url": "https://x.com/James_s123s/status/2117541325046206499"}, {"author_id": "1219037676474527745", "created_at": "2026-11-03T11:03:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117573304777371687"], "id": "2117573304777371687", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 3154, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "4只宽基ETF（上证50、创业板、沪深300、科创50）今日成交额均破百亿，\n\n为2024年“924行情”以来首次，说明场内资金在用ETF对冲或抄底，而不是个股。", "url": "https://x.com/WindRider_Stock/status/2117573304777371687"}, {"author_id": "1115488684353052678", "created_at": "2026-11-03T11:11:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117575505570656272"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/xianzhizhou/st…", "end": 193, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/xianzhizhou/status/2117535599007871185", "start": 170, "url": "https://t.co/yTqkZX9Dh7"}]}, "id": "2117575505570656272", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 77, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117535599007871185", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "今天最有意思的不是跌了多少，是跌的时候有人大手笔接货。沪指收3608.10点，跌0.82%，创业板跌2.73%，跌破2400点，科创50跌了3.81%。超3300只下跌，半导体和算力领跌。但同一天，上证50ETF华夏、创业板ETF易方达、沪深300ETF华泰柏瑞、科创50ETF华夏，四只宽基ETF成交额全都破了百亿，2024年9月以来第 https://t.co/yTqkZX9Dh7", "url": "https://x.com/sharwowwow/status/2117575505570656272"}, {"author_id": "1752993330567446528", "created_at": "2026-11-03T08:00:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117527401571987463"], "id": "2117527401571987463", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 58, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "A股ETF成交突然放量。今日有4只宽基ETF成交额突破100亿元：创业板ETF易方达152亿、科创50ETF华夏135亿、上证50ETF华夏121亿、沪深300ETF华泰柏瑞100亿。其中，上证50ETF成交额较昨日放大368%！这是2024年“924行情”以来首次出现4只宽基ETF同日成交破百亿。资金交易热度明显升温，市场又开始活跃起来了？", "url": "https://x.com/hitu1499551/status/2117527401571987463"}, {"author_id": "2389407782", "created_at": "2026-11-03T16:21:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117653467330380262"], "id": "2117653467330380262", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 329, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "保持乐观\n【东财策略陈果/金科】今日重点ETF成交显著放量，全天成交额约1540亿元。总量上看，今日GJD重仓ETF成交额在过去约60次托底案例中处于100%的极高分位，托底力度极", "url": "https://x.com/baishuishanren/status/2117653467330380262"}, {"author_id": "137332930", "created_at": "2026-11-03T15:25:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117639281410019683"], "id": "2117639281410019683", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 4624, "like_count": 8, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "上证50、沪深300、科创50、创业板四大宽基ETF成交额均超100亿，这是924行情以来首次，\n\n有护盘资金逆势进场。\n\n今日互换便利1000亿已经到位，\n\n银行还为中国国新、中国诚通提供2000亿流动性，", "url": "https://x.com/cnfinancewatch/status/2117639281410019683"}, {"author_id": "2108191189019381760", "created_at": "2026-11-02T13:25:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117246809437594067"], "id": "2117246809437594067", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 970, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "高盛中国收盘速评\n\n指数行情:上证综指 3638.03 点,上涨 1.08%;上证 50 指数 2762.54 点,上涨 0.75%;沪深 300 指数 4016.92 点,上涨 0.79%;科创 50 指数 1196.9 点;创业板指 2458.7 点;中证 500 指数 6420 点。\n全市场成交额 1.79 万亿元,较前一日上涨 6.5%。\n板块表现\n涨幅靠前板块:1. 传媒 2.", "url": "https://x.com/FY30Turbo/status/2117246809437594067"}, {"author_id": "2059234548677009408", "created_at": "2026-11-03T10:00:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117557537210028061"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/KDmu05qJ9P", "end": 179, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Gutenberg1450/status/2117557537210028061/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117557520546017280", "start": 156, "url": "https://t.co/KDmu05qJ9P"}]}, "id": "2117557537210028061", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 6, "impression_count": 10242, "like_count": 19, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 8, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "凭良心说，国家队今天是真干活了。\n\n宽基ETF这边，总成交额超1700亿。\n\n其中，创业板ETF易方达全天超190亿、上证50ETF华夏超128亿；\n\n科创50ETF华夏超220亿，沪深300华泰柏瑞ETF超190亿。\n\n这样的天量，是2024年“9·24行情”后第一次出现，也硬生生的把指数在下午捞回来一点。 https://t.co/KDmu05qJ9P", "url": "https://x.com/Gutenberg1450/status/2117557537210028061"}, {"author_id": "1451670472504975365", "created_at": "2026-11-03T07:14:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117515770452217942"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/guyisheng1/sta…", "end": 170, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/guyisheng1/status/2117515300111540257", "start": 147, "url": "https://t.co/ZY4kcwE3OA"}]}, "id": "2117515770452217942", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 650, "like_count": 11, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117515300111540257", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "上证50ETF华夏、创业板ETF易方达、沪深300ETF华泰柏瑞、科创50ETF华夏，四只ETF成交额同日突破百亿元。这是自2024年“924行情”以来首次出现这样的情况。四只覆盖不同指数的宽基ETF同时放量，显然不是普通的市场交易现象。尤其在指数持续调整的背景下，这种资金动作值得高度重视。 https://t.co/ZY4kcwE3OA", "url": "https://x.com/guxiaqidan/status/2117515770452217942"}, {"author_id": "1128198342859563008", "created_at": "2026-11-02T13:23:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117246292837716136"], "id": "2117246292837716136", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 391, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "📑 高盛中国收盘速评\n\n📊 指数行情：上证综指 3638.03 点，上涨 1.08%；上证 50 指数 2762.54 点，上涨 0.75%；沪深 300 指数 4016.92 点，上涨 0.79%；科创 50 指数 1196.9 点；创业板指 2458.7 点；中证 500 指数 6420 点。\n📌 全市场成交额 1.79 万亿元，较前一日上涨 6.5%。\n📌 板块表现\n✅", "url": "https://x.com/ming69621583/status/2117246292837716136"}, {"author_id": "1069442551097245696", "created_at": "2026-11-03T13:29:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117609998997918007"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/PtPXL767xu", "end": 176, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/ganluluo/status/2117609998997918007/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117609939518541824", "start": 153, "url": "https://t.co/PtPXL767xu"}]}, "id": "2117609998997918007", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "换锚第二天收盘，三大指数集体下跌。\n\n11月3日，A股三大指数集体下跌。截至收盘，沪指报3608.10点，跌0.82%；深证成指报10876.99点，跌1.21%；创业板指报2391.65点，跌2.73%，跌破2400点；科创50报1151.28点，跌3.81%；北证50报855.06点，跌4.02%。 https://t.co/PtPXL767xu", "url": "https://x.com/ganluluo/status/2117609998997918007"}, {"author_id": "2035018650965745664", "created_at": "2026-11-03T07:30:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117519838231093642"], "id": "2117519838231093642", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1208, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "护盘的还在。数据显示，午后宽基ETF持续放量，上证50ETF华夏（510050）成交超110亿，环比上一日增超3倍，创业板ETF易方达（159915）成交超150亿，沪深300ETF华泰柏瑞（510300）、科创50ETF华夏（588000）成交超100亿元，自2024年“924行情”以来首次出现4只ETF成交额超100亿，中证500ETF南方（510500）成", "url": "https://x.com/wolf200131313/status/2117519838231093642"}, {"author_id": "3302713589", "created_at": "2026-11-03T16:40:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117658132356940243"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/9IcgmGRwMt", "end": 176, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Maksek1234/status/2117658132356940243/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117658118222168073", "start": 153, "url": "https://t.co/9IcgmGRwMt"}]}, "id": "2117658132356940243", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 237, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "凭良心说，今天国家队是真下场干活了。\n宽基ETF干到1700多亿成交额，科创50、创业板、上证50、沪深300那几个头部ETF全都爆量，这个级别还是24年924行情之后头一回，下午硬生生把指数捞回来一点。\n还有传闻说要暂停IPO和增发，看样子是准备连环出招了。\n但话说回来，我们现在就该满怀期待冲进去吗？ https://t.co/9IcgmGRwMt", "url": "https://x.com/Maksek1234/status/2117658132356940243"}, {"author_id": "541462295", "created_at": "2026-11-03T11:14:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117576103720321139"], "id": "2117576103720321139", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 70, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "今天ETF资金流入金额约800亿元，本轮单日最高！其中，全天共有6只宽基ETF成交额超百亿，大哥护盘都护得冒烟了。", "url": "https://x.com/zhaoge168/status/2117576103720321139"}, {"author_id": "2046490815967657984", "created_at": "2026-11-03T12:15:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117591370139652413"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/awnPtNQue1", "end": 85, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/luluai239/status/2117591370139652413/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117585368681943040", "start": 62, "url": "https://t.co/awnPtNQue1"}]}, "id": "2117591370139652413", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 577, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "看了下，今天ETF资金流入金额约800亿元，本轮单日最高！其中，全天共有6只宽基ETF成交额超百亿，大哥护盘都护得冒烟了。 https://t.co/awnPtNQue1", "url": "https://x.com/luluai239/status/2117591370139652413"}, {"author_id": "1634530036152963072", "created_at": "2026-11-03T13:56:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117615621034901999", "2117617028626272517"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/TFULLyaLaA", "end": 194, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/maobidao/status/21176170